    {
      "source": "A component for post-processing retrieved documents based on a query, addressing\nchallenges such as \"lost-in-the-middle\", context length restrictions from the model,\nand the need to reduce noise and redundancy in the retrieved information.",
      "translation": "一种用于基于查询对检索到的文档进行后处理的组件，旨在解决诸如“中间丢失”、模型上下文长度限制以及减少检索信息中的噪声和冗余等挑战。",
      "count": 1
